---
import Site from '../layouts/Site.astro';
---
<Site
  title="Preorder received — the Muster manual"
  description="Your preorder of the Muster manual is recorded. Delivery by 31 October 2026, and founding pricing on the software when it ships."
  path="/thanks"
  narrow
>
  <section style="padding:clamp(40px,7vw,72px) 0 0;">
    <div class="kicker" style="margin-bottom:16px;">receipt · recorded</div>
    <h1 style="font-size:clamp(25px,5.6vw,36px);line-height:1.18;font-weight:500;letter-spacing:-.015em;text-wrap:balance;">That's a preorder. Thank you.</h1>
    <p style="margin:20px 0 0;font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.8;text-wrap:pretty;">Your $99 is recorded and dated. The manual lands in your inbox by 31 October. If it slips you will read it on the log the same day we know, which is the deal.</p>
    <p style="margin:16px 0 0;font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.8;text-wrap:pretty;">You are also on the founding list: when the software opens, your price is the preorder price, permanently.</p>
    <p style="margin:16px 0 0;font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.8;text-wrap:pretty;">Nothing else is needed from you. Stripe has your receipt.</p>
    <div style="margin-top:28px;display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:10px;">
      <a href="/log" class="btn-primary" style="flex:1 1 200px;">Read the field notes</a>
      <a href="/" class="btn-ghost" style="flex:1 1 200px;">Back to Muster</a>
    </div>
  </section>
</Site>
